  <item>
    <title>Vol.17【音阶对谈】振浩：始于蓝调的音乐旅途</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a6b4a1d56a3f3491ba79407</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a6b4a1d56a3f3491ba79407</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 13:49:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nr0ApXX1xWkePKWa1cCz_tbEgdXA.jpg"><p><span>去年年末，某一天下班后，我第一个到排练室，等乐队其他成员一起过来排练，结果发现了一个在角落里默默地用吉他弹着布鲁斯的低调帅哥，于是我走上前去问他有没有听过 BB King 和Eric Clapton，结果他不光全部听过，而且上手就能弹，还弹得特别好！于是我便认识了振浩，一起度过了很多弹琴、聊音乐、看MV、开车在路上的即兴时光。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvqLzhBhnyagrfvfeaTgWtAA4BPr.jpg"><p><span>振浩虽然现在还在读书，但是已经积累了非常丰富的舞台表演经验。即兴弹奏流行歌，布鲁斯，放克，都不在话下。他有很多来自同龄同行的外号，像电机John Mayer 啦，滴水湖梁博啦，不过他本人非常礼貌谦虚，总是说自己只是在做热爱的事情。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nioXjk0gFao0ePB-en_agx5oftQF.jpg"><p><span>这次与振浩的合作也是我在做音阶对谈系列以来完成效率最高的一次，当天录完，隔了两天便制作好。我想这是因为我们平常就是以这样的状态来聊音乐、源源不断想到自己喜欢的下一首歌。音乐是我们生活的一部份，那么也希望能够把我们听到喜欢的那些声音时内心雀跃的感觉，分享给耳机/音响前的你们。</span></p><hr><p></p><p><span>Playlist:</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a> Charlie Wilson - Forever Valentine</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="254">4:14</a> Eric Clapton - One Track Mind</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="711">11:51</a> B.B. King &amp; Eric Clapton - Riding with the King</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> Micheal Jackson - Human Nature</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1291">21:31</a> Eric Clapton - Tears in Heaven</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1669">27:49</a> Christopher Cross - Sailing</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2009">33:29</a> Christopher Cross - Arthur’s Theme</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2442">40:42</a> Rod Stewart - Sailing</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2720">45:20</a> 朴树 - No Fear in My Heart</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3217">53:37</a> 梁博 - 危险</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3666">1:01:06</a> 李荣浩 - 太坦白</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3999">1:06:39</a> 张震岳 - 浪人的…</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4296">1:11:36</a> 张震岳 - 我要钱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4679">1:17:59</a> John Mayer - Slow Dancing in a Burning Room</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4988">1:23:08</a> The Band - The Weight</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5316">1:28:36</a> 海龟先生 - Where are you going?</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63bc1b5087b6bd890204969d/lqvUFjTHrBsL0Y3tU1O5Dl-jASP8.m4a" length="89910646" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:32:39</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgkSNkkWYkoHpCFAvWB4Ox3PA6wm.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
