  <item>
    <title>Vol.13 黑鸟，白鸟，自由鸟</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69bffc0d2d318777c92cbe83</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69bffc0d2d318777c92cbe83</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Mar 2026 15:03:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk1Y1KpyBY9VNlH4Uk63U9p9ZTN7.jpg"></figure><p><span>在诸多文艺作品中，不管是音乐，文学，还是影视作品，“鸟”这一意象，因为具备飞翔的属性，常常被用来作为自由、不羁、勇敢的隐喻。</span></p><p><span>这次，就让我我们来聊聊我喜欢的摇滚乐里的那些鸟儿。</span></p><p><span>这是我节目的第20期发布，也是我最私人、最真挚的一期节目。</span></p><p><span>Playlist:</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a> The Beatles - Blackbird</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="216">3:36</a> It’s a Beautiful Day - White Bird</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">9:50</a> Noel Gallagher’s High Flying Birds - Everybody’s On The Run</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="985">16:25</a> Lynyrd Skynyrd - Free Bird</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtDqBqI3h7qjWQ7qHN-S88O8qoNl.jpg"></figure><p><span>Rishikesh, India</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63bc1b5087b6bd890204969d/lrTpptqVfjxicw2BDWEGxHRUSA97.m4a" length="24817378" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:25:33</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq2zSJxTTIUdA5-607351yAXS6Jz.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
