  <item>
    <title>Vol.11 舞！舞！舞！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68bfdb6ea56ca3e0c4869b72</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68bfdb6ea56ca3e0c4869b72</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 09 Sep 2025 07:53:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目灵感来源于前段时间在阿根廷影展看的展映电影《最后探戈》，我一直觉得会跳舞的人特别有魅力，能够自由地跟随音乐舒展自己的身体是一件多么美妙畅快的事情。特别是看完这部电影后，我又再一次强烈燃起了“动起来”的欲望。于是，我从自己最近常听的音乐里，选取了这几首节奏强烈充满动感的电子乐，完成了这期节目。适合跑步、骑行、驾驶、派对，或者只是想要一个人起舞时收听。Enjoy!</span></p><p><em><span>Featuring: Globe, The Strokes, Jamie xx, Jungle</span></em></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlM5rDLQ06Pnv1zM-g2-JfzgC7gV.jpg"></figure><p><strong><span>本期歌曲列表</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a> </span></strong><span>The Strokes - Tap Out</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="219">3:39</a> Globe - Feel Like Dance</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="567">9:27</a> Jamie xx - LET'S DO IT AGAIN</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="987">16:27</a> Jungle - Keep Moving</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1224">20:24</a> Bob Marley &amp; The Wailers - Waiting in Vain</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63bc1b5087b6bd890204969d/lusWVFTMExbuCgqttyRa67PQfzlV.m4a" length="35639777" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:24:33</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuiFmoy5NCJJQoo-jBpWd2OQ0-14.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
