  <item>
    <title>Vol.10 低音的涌动，贝斯的狂欢</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68936c3446542d8c41d61e9a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68936c3446542d8c41d61e9a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 06 Aug 2025 14:55:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天给大家分享一些令人欲罢不能的bass lines, 所以你还在开贝斯笑话，问“诶，贝斯在哪里怎么听不到？”分享贝斯“是静音乐器”的段子和梗图吗？这些经典的bass riff 会让你眼界大开， 无法自拔。前排提示，你需要一副好的耳机或者音箱，来彻底释放低音的魅力，那么，我们开始吧——</span></p><p><em><span>Featuring: Aerosmith, Nirvana, The Beatles, The Clash, The Strokes, The Doors</span></em></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh9HjnRf-Af0zleRH37070gGfwcV.webp"></figure><p><strong><span>本期歌曲列表</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">0:49</a> Aerosmith - Sweet Emotion</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="342">5:42</a> Nirvana - Come As You Are</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="636">10:36</a> The Beatles - Come Together</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="971">16:11</a> The Clash - The Guns of Brixton</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1197">19:57</a> The Strokes - Is This It</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1370">22:50</a> The Doors - Riders on the Storm</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63bc1b5087b6bd890204969d/lrlfiqrfpDTVXM_N2QkzGzbQf-Ek.m4a" length="43551998" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:30:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqzsPTX5Gq1tB9CUCx5NG9khx_8C.png"/>
