  <item>
    <title>Vol.09【音阶对谈】阿乾-04: 我们需要更加细腻炽热的感知</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/681da00db7c8a9962c37a09b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">681da00db7c8a9962c37a09b</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 09 May 2025 06:27:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>（本次发布为这期节目的最后一部分）</span></p><p><span>欢迎收听沉沦音乐。这次我邀请了我在伦敦的挚友</span><strong><span>阿乾</span></strong><span>来分享他喜欢的音乐。阿乾是一名资深园艺师，常驻伦敦，在设计、绘画方面都有很高的造诣。我还在伦敦的时候，我们经常一起看展、看电影、去英国其他城市day trip。 即使没有什么活动，也可以沿着泰晤士河畔随随便便边走边听音乐边聊好几个小时。我非常喜欢阿乾对于爵士乐的感知，给我提供了很不一样的欣赏爵士的视角。《沉沦音乐》这档节目还没有放过与爵士相关的音乐，那我想与阿乾一起开启这段探索再好不过。</span></p><p><em><span>Featuring: Frank Sinatra, Ella Fitzgerald, Judge Dread, Nina Simone, Sam Cooke, Bob Marley</span></em></p><p><span>本期歌曲列表：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="314">5:14</a> Sam Cooke - Just Another Day</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="582">9:42</a> Sam Cooke - I Cover the Waterfront</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="923">15:23</a> Frank Sinatra - Maybe You’ll Be There</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1444">24:04</a> Frank Sinatra - You Go to My Head</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a> Jimmy Durant - I’ll See You in My Dreams</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2085">34:45</a> Nina Simone - One September Day</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63bc1b5087b6bd890204969d/lv0TCM342OcuLTNRVLzly-e7bE5T.m4a" length="54576653" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:37:36</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnQHb1xKJtyOPlqi-RnEHOkEFlSx.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
